  "notes": {
    "raw": "Phase changes: 544.59 K, melting point of Bi; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.700$ kcal/mol.\n1837 K, boiling point of Bi to equilibrium mixture of Bi(g) and $Bi_{2}(g)$ . \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 3 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 7 4 5 + 0. 2 9 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 3 5 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 7 4 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 1 4 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 3 5 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 7 3 9 \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 5 4 4. 5 9 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 2 5. 0 9 6 + 1. 2 5 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 3. 2 1 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 7 8. 2 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 2 5. 0 9 6 - 1. 2 5 0 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\ln T + 3. 2 1 5 x 1 0 ^ {- 6} T ^ {2} + 3 9. 1 2 5 T ^ {- 1} - 1 3. 8 8 8 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\\\ 5 4 4. 5 9 - 1 8 3 7 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 2 2. 3 1 9 - 1. 2 8 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 1 7 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 3 7 8. 8 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta \\mathrm{Gr} ^ {\\circ} = 2 2. 3 1 9 + 1. 2 8 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 1 7 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 1 8 9. 4 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2 3. 5 7 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nSources: Enthalpy of formation at 298 K based on Cubicciotti (26), Prusaczyk (101), and Uy (121). Other data based on Barrow (5-6). ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "Phase changes: 544.59 K, melting point of Bi; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.700$ kcal/mol.",
      "1837 K, boiling point of Bi to equilibrium mixture of Bi(g) and $Bi_{2}(g)$ .",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "$$",
      "\\begin{array}{r l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 3 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 7 4 5 + 0. 2 9 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 3 5 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 7 4 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 1 4 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 3 5 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 7 3 9 \\end{array}",
      "$$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "$$",
      "\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 5 4 4. 5 9 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 2 5. 0 9 6 + 1. 2 5 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 3. 2 1 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 7 8. 2 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 2 5. 0 9 6 - 1. 2 5 0 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\ln T + 3. 2 1 5 x 1 0 ^ {- 6} T ^ {2} + 3 9. 1 2 5 T ^ {- 1} - 1 3. 8 8 8 x 1 0 ^ {- 3} T \\\\ 5 4 4. 5 9 - 1 8 3 7 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 2 2. 3 1 9 - 1. 2 8 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 1 7 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 3 7 8. 8 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta \\mathrm{Gr} ^ {\\circ} = 2 2. 3 1 9 + 1. 2 8 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 1 7 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 1 8 9. 4 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2 3. 5 7 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ \\end{array}",
      "$$",
      "Sources: Enthalpy of formation at 298 K based on Cubicciotti (26), Prusaczyk (101), and Uy (121). Other data based on Barrow (5-6)."
    ],
